#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Account verified, but no usable current workspace was returned."
msgstr "账户验证成功，但未返回可用的当前工作区。"

msgid "Action Scheduler is outside the active runtime stack for this site."
msgstr "此站点的活动运行环境不包含 Action Scheduler。"

msgid ""
"Action Scheduler workload evidence is available after its runtime store "
