msgstr "已启用"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Active plugins"
msgstr "已启用的插件"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Active · verify"
msgstr "已启用 · 待验证"

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid "Adapter planned"
msgstr "已规划适配器"

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid "Add privileged read-only host helper, then guarded diff/apply/rollback."
msgstr "添加具有特权的只读主机辅助程序，然后执行受保护的差异比较、应用和回滚。"

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid "Add provider-neutral edge adapter after native page-cache adoption."
msgstr "接管原生页面缓存后，添加与服务提供方无关的边缘缓存适配器。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Admin Health"
msgstr "后台健康状态"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Admin UI follows the WordPress administrator locale. A language is complete "
"only after full key parity and translation QA."
msgstr "管理后台界面遵循 WordPress 管理员的语言设置。只有完成全部字符串翻译并通过翻译质量检查，才能将该语言标记为完成。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Admin memory not constrained"
msgstr "后台内存不受限"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Admin resource state"
msgstr "后台资源状态"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Admin worker reserve visible"
msgstr "后台工作进程预留量可见"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adopt Current FPM Budget"
msgstr "接管当前 PHP-FPM 资源预算"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adopt YPerf Cloudflare profile"
msgstr "接管 YPerf Cloudflare 配置"

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"Adopt a fresh, proven native page-cache executor before preparing host "
"operations."
msgstr "准备主机操作前，先接管新的、已验证的原生页面缓存执行器。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adopt aligned profile & enable purge sync"
msgstr "接管已对齐的配置并启用清除同步"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adopt performance profile"
msgstr "接管性能配置"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adopt proven Nginx page cache"
msgstr "接管已验证的 Nginx 页面缓存"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adopt the existing PHP-FPM worker boundary"
msgstr "接管现有 PHP-FPM 工作进程边界"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adopting Cloudflare profile…"
msgstr "正在接管 Cloudflare 配置…"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adoption Mode"
msgstr "接管模式"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Adoption can still be useful: it establishes YPerf ownership and enables "
"synchronized Cloudflare purge without rewriting settings that already match."
msgstr "接管仍有价值：它可确立 YPerf 的管理归属，并启用同步清除 Cloudflare 缓存，而无需重写已经符合要求的设置。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Adoption current"
msgstr "接管状态为最新"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Adoption is a local authority record only. Nginx config, cache files, "
"provider settings and service state remain untouched."
msgstr "接管只是本地管理权限记录。Nginx 配置、缓存文件、服务提供方设置及服务状态均不会改变。"

